_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076240/extras/GifDialog.gif?t=1748720755\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uncover What Lurks in the Dark</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everything can be explained. But the more you see, the more you know something is wrong.<br>Something hides just outside the light. Don\u2019t look too long \u2014 it might look back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076240/extras/GifDark.gif?t=1748720755\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric Psychological Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro VHS Aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-Person Caf\u00e9 Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Branching Dialogue &amp; Multiple Endings</p></li></ul>","developers":["Frost Fox Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3076240/0bb1257f6d12e767c1308fab4539cb1d8e222298/header.jpg?t=1748720755","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257149047,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149047/movie480.mp4?t=1748720753","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149047/movie_max.mp4?t=1748720753"},"name":"True Nightmare: Roadside Cafe - Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149047/4b7c1bad051c4c7b0d23e0733969152916866f67/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748720753","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149047/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748720753",